# YouTube Creator Discovery Assistant

Discover the right creators, write smarter comments with AI, and grow faster.

## What this project does

This app helps users:

- find small YouTube creators in a chosen niche
- filter videos by subscriber count, engagement, and comment count
- generate AI-assisted comment suggestions
- copy comments and open videos quickly
- unlock full access after free usage is finished

## Current product logic

- users must register or log in to search
- each user gets 5 free searches
- after free usage ends, the user sees a one-time payment unlock
- paid users should not see the unlock prompt again
- auth is email/password based

## Main features

- email/password register and login
- protected search endpoint
- free usage tracking per user
- AI comment suggestions
- YouTube creator/video discovery from stored database results
- Stripe checkout integration for one-time unlock
- forgot password flow
- bulk seed loading and ingestion pipeline
- cron-ready ingestion structure

## Tech stack

### Backend
- FastAPI
- SQLAlchemy
- SQLite
- JWT auth
- Stripe
- Ollama

### Frontend
- HTML
- CSS
- Vanilla JavaScript

